(41,16,7,31,'Kattakurgan city','review',0,NULL,'<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Atlassian Sans&quot;, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(206, 207, 210); white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">❇️ VIDEO RAQAMI: 46</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"19\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Atlassian Sans&quot;, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(206, 207, 210); white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">📌 VAZIFA: Yaxshilab stiliga moslab video qilish kerak</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Atlassian Sans&quot;, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Ubuntu, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.714; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: rgb(206, 207, 210); white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">📜 MATERIAL LINKI:  G:\\+Projects\\Kattakurgan City\\46</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\"><font color=\"#cecfd2\" face=\"Atlassian Sans, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Ubuntu, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; letter-spacing: -0.07px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">📜 MATERIAL LINKI: </span></font>&nbsp;</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">Kattakurgan City’dan xonadon xarid qilmoqchi bo‘lgan hurmatli mijozlar diqqatiga!</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\"><br></p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">Sizlarga muhim ma’lumotni rasman e’lon qilamiz.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\"><br></p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">Kattakurgan City turar-joy majmuasidagi xonadonlar narxi 500 ming so‘mga oshirilganini ma’lum qilamiz.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\"><br></p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">Mazkur narx yangilanishi qurilish bosqichining jadal rivojlanishi hamda loyihaga bo‘lgan talabning ortishi bilan bog‘liq.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\"><br></p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">Avvalgi narxda shartnoma rasmiylashtirgan mijozlarimiz o‘z xonadonlarini o‘sha narxda saqlab qolishdi.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\"><br></p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">Yangi murojaatlar esa yangilangan narx asosida qabul qilinadi.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\"><br></p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">Agar siz ham Kattakurgan City’dan xonadon olishni rejalashtirayotgan bo‘lsangiz, hoziroq qaror qabul qilishingizni tavsiya etamiz.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\"><br></p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">Kelgusida narxlar yana oshishi ehtimoli mavjud.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\"><br></p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"31\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.714; background-color: rgb(36, 37, 40);\">Kattakurgan City — siz orzu qilgan kelajak aynan shu yerdan boshlanadi.<font color=\"#cecfd2\" face=\"Atlassian Sans, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Ubuntu, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.07px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">.</span></font></p>',NULL,2400,'2026-03-03 11:19:42','2026-03-09 04:55:01'),
