(134,18,7,17,'Shoxona','review',1,NULL,'<p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">❇️ VIDEO RAQAMI: 15</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📌 VAZIFA:&nbsp; Yaxshilab&nbsp; stiliga moslab dizayn qilish kerak!</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📜 MATERIAL LINKI:&nbsp;G:\\+Projects\\Shoxona\\15<br>📜 MATERIAL LINKI:</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Siz ham «Shoxonada faqat sendvich bor» deb o‘ylaysizmi? Adashasiz!</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Biz endi yangi mahsulotlar ishlab chiqarishni boshladik — hozir birma-bir ko‘rsataman.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Birinchisi — Shoxona burgelari.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Ichida yumshoq bulochka, shirali kotlet, mazali sous va pishloq.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Bir marta tatib ko‘rasiz — keyin yana xohlaysiz.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Ikkinchisi — sendvichlar uchun maxsus nonlar.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Bu oddiy non emas: yumshoq, pahmoq, juda ham yoqimli.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Ichiga o‘zingiz xohlagan masalliqlarni qo‘shib, uyda ham tezda zo‘r sendvich tayyorlaysiz.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Uchinchisi — salatlar uchun kesilgan non bo‘laklari.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Istalgan salatga qo‘shasiz — ta’mi darrov ochilib ketadi.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Qulay, tez va juda mazali.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">To‘rtinchisi — eng yoqimlisi: Shoxona Raffaello shokoladlari.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Shirinliksevarlar uchun dumaloq shokoladlar maxsus qadoqda — sovg‘a uchun ham zo‘r.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Xullas, Shoxona endi faqat sendvich emas —&nbsp; ko‘proq turdagi mahsulotlarni ishlab chiqarishniboshladi.</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Agar sizga ham mahsulotlarimizdan kerak bo‘lsa yoki hamkorlik qilmoqchi bo‘lsangiz, quyidagi raqamlar orqali murojaat qilsangiz bo\'ladi!</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p>',NULL,3200,'2026-03-05 12:33:36','2026-03-13 06:05:43'),
