nt-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">1-xato: Juda tor jinsi — qomatni buzadi. <span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">2-xato: Past bel — obrazni arzon ko‘rsatadi. <span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">3-xato: Sport ustki kiyim bilan ofis sumkasi — stil aralashib ketadi. <span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">To‘g‘ri variant: toza fasondagi jinsi + klassik ko‘ylak yoki pidjak. Darhol balans paydo bo‘ladi. <span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">Jinsi ham elegant bo‘lishi mumkin — agar uni to‘g‘ri yig‘sangiz. <span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">Molto Caldo’da jinsi bi