m-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Ismingiz?</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— ..... (Ismini aytadi).</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Siz uchun eng yuqori ball olish oson bo‘ldimi?</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Yo\'q, oson bo‘lmadi, lekin bilimli ustozlarim va kuchli<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; </span>tayyorgarlik sabab maqsadimga erishdim.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\">2-o‘quvchi:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Sertifikat olishda nima eng ko‘p yordam berdi deb o\'ylaysiz?</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Doimiy testlar va ustozlarning talabchanligi.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\">3-o‘quvchi:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Imtihon kuni o‘zingizni qanday his qildingiz?</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Imtihonga shonch bilan kirdim. Chunki Samarqand til maktabida olgan bilimlarim bilan sertifikat olishimga ishonardim..</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\">4-o‘quvchi:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Natijangizdan qoniqdingizmi?</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Albatta. Eng yuqori ball olish men uchun katta yutuq bo‘ldi.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">Buning uchun Samarqand til maktabiga va ustozlarimga katta rahmat aytaman.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\">5-o‘quvchi:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Boshlanishida natijangiz qanday edi?</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Ko\'p narsani bilmasdim. Samarqand til maktabidaginustozlarimdan olgan bilimlarim orqali bu sertifikatni qo\'lga kiritdim.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\">6-o‘quvchi:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— Bu sertifikat sizga nima berdi?</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\">— O‘z kuchimga ishonch va katta imkoniyatlar berdi.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>7-o‘quvc