zneslarga qaraganda ikki barobar ko\'p!</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">&nbsp;O\'z vaqtida Stiv Jobs Mark Sukerbergga yo\'l ko\'rsatgan. Uorren Baffet esa Bill Geytsga ustozlik qilgan. Eng zo`rlar ham yolg\'iz harakat qilmagan!</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Ustoz — bu siz hali ko\'rmagan chuqurlarni ko\'rib turgan odam. U sizni xato qilishdan emas, balki qimmatga tushadigan xatolardan qutqaradi.&nbsp;</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Sizning biznesda ustozingiz bormi? Kommentariyada yozing!</p>',NULL,NULL,'2026-03-26 21:25:19','2026-04-03 05:03:49'),
