(1173,29,35,35,'Shaxriyor biolog','open',1,NULL,'<p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">📌 VAZIFA:</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Сцена 1. Пруд. Появляется ребёнок.(НА УЗБЕКСКОМ)</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Отец (смотрит на головастика):</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">— Это что вообще такое?</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Мать:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">— Это наш ребёнок.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Отец (злится):</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">— Ты мне изменяла? С кем? С рыбой? Он не похож на лягушку! Это не мой!</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Отец уходит искать «отца».</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #808080; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Сцена 2. Рыба.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Отец:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">— Это твой ребёнок?</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Рыба:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">— Ты нормальный?&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">мои мальки покрыты чешуёй, у них есть плавники</span></p>\n<br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"><p></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Отец уходит дальше.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #808080; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Сцена 3. Другие водные животные (например, рак, улитка).</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Отец:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">— Это ваш ребёнок?</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Рак:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">— Нет.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Улитка:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">— Нет.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Отец уходит дальше.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #808080; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Сцена 4. Биолог на берегу.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Отец:</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">— У меня проблема. Ребёнок не похож на меня.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 19.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"