(1315,28,39,22,'STM ','review',1,NULL,'<p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">❇️ VIDEO RAQAMI: 20</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📌 VAZIFA:&nbsp;</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📜 MATERIAL LINKI:</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n\n<!--StartFragment--><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-f1f1fbb4-7fff-49e1-d98c-2420f36d1bdf\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">\"Rostini aytsam, tarix darsida faqat sanalarni yodlashdan zerikib ketgan edim. 1219-yil, 1370-yil... Bu raqamlar menga hech narsa bermasdi.\" </span></b><!--EndFragment-->\n\n<br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">\n\n<!--StartFragment--><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-8f4067e8-7fff-b37a-c9df-e3782c0dfb68\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">\"Lekin bu yerga kelib tushundimki, gap raqamlarda emas, ularning ortidagi voqealarda ekan.\" </span></b><!--EndFragment-->\n\n\n<!--StartFragment--><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-ab36a832-7fff-dd39-1a0a-ef841f0875a4\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">\"Bizda darslar quruq kitob o‘qish emas. Ustozimiz har bir voqeani xuddi qiziqarli bir hikoyadek gapirib beradi. Kim nima uchun urushgan, nega bunday qaror qabul qilgan — hammasini tushuntiradi. Xuddi qiziq bir kino ko‘rayotgandek o‘tiramiz. Eng qizig‘i, voqeani tushunsangiz, o‘sha \'qiyin\' sanalar ham o‘z-o‘zidan esingizda qolib ketar ekan. Hozir men uchun tarix — eng zerikarli fan emas, eng qiziqarli sayohatga aylandi.\" </span></b><!--EndFragment-->\n\n\n\n<!--StartFragment--><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-932bdd65-7fff-0c18-0684-aee7fb1b0312\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">\"Siz ham tarixni qiynalmay o‘rganishni xohlaysizmi? Shunchaki bir marta kelib ko‘ring, o‘zingiz ishonasiz.</span></b><!--EndFragment-->\n\n\n<br></span></b></p>',NULL,NULL,'2026-04-11 12:40:27','2026-04-17 04:54:22'),
