(DTM) standartlari asosida o‘tiladi. Har bir mavzu o‘tgan yillardagi testlar bilan mustahkamlanadi.</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #434343 1.5pt;border-right:solid #434343 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid #434343 1.5pt;border-top:solid #434343 1.5pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 14.17322834645671pt;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">O\'tgan yili bizda tayyorlangan o‘quvchilarning 90% dan ortig‘i grant va kontrakt asosida nufuzli OTMlarga qabul qilindi. Biz sizga nafaqat bilim, balki imtihon psixologiyasini ham o\'rgatamiz.</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #434343 1.5pt;border-right:solid #434343 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid #434343 1.5pt;border-top:solid #434343 1.5pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 14.17322834645671pt;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Siz ham cheklovsiz imkoniyatlar dunyosiga qadam qo\'ying. Birinchi bepul darsga yozilish uchun \"Talaba\" so\'zini yozib qoldiring.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 14.17322834645671pt;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">(Sotuvchi kontent, info, Target video)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><!--EndFragment-->\n\n<p></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'2026-04-17 10:54:03','20