>SAHNA 2. BOSHQA OLAM</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Keskin montaj.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Xuddi shu tovush:</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">qoshiq laganga tegadi.</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Issiq palovdan bug‘ ko‘tariladi — jangdan chiqqan tutun kabi.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Yaqin planlar:</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">guruch, go‘sht, sabzi — xuddi doskadagi figuralardek.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #808080; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">SAHNA 3. BIRINCHI TA’M</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">U palovdan tatib ko‘radi.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Bu yerda “mo‘jiza” yo‘q, balki his:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc\">\n<li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">guruch donalari → variantlar</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">yog‘ning jilosi → hujum chiziqlari</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">ziravorlar → kutilmagan yurishlar</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Vizual: shaxmat doskasi sekin palov ichida “paydo” bo‘la boshlaydi.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #808080; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">SAHNA 4. ICHKI O‘YIN</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Montaj tezlashadi.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">U ovqatlanadi — va parallel:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc\">\n<li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">figuralar tezroq harakatlanadi</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">kombinatsiyalar murakkablashadi</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">nigohi yanada aniq bo‘ladi</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Muhim nuqta:</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">palov kuch bermaydi, </span><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">ritm beradi</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">.</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">U diqqatni yig‘ish nuqtasiga aylanadi.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #808080; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">SAHNA 5. KULMINATSIYA</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Yana turnir.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Raqib asabiy.</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">U esa xotirjam yuradi.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Pauza.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Shoh.</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Yana bir yurish.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Mat.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #808080; min-height: 13.8px\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">SAHNA 6. YAKUN</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">U yana palov oldida.</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Bu safar shoshilmay.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; font: 20.0px \'Times New Roman\'; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000\"><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">Ekranda matn:</span><span style=\" font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\"><br>\n</span><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-kerning: none\">“Har bir yurish aniqlik talab qiladi. G‘alabaning o‘z ta’mini top.”</span></p>\n<br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"><p></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📜 MATERIAL LINKI:</p>',NULL,NULL,'2026-04-21 09:20:44','2026-05-06 10:32:29'),
