(1825,12,39,30,'Sogda','review',1,NULL,'<div>📌 VAZIFA: Animatsiya&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>📜 MATNI:&nbsp;</div><div>\n\n<!--StartFragment--><h3 data-path-to-node=\"2\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1-slayd:&nbsp;</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"3\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sarlavha:</b> Mukammallik — bizning standartimiz.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Asosiy matn:</b> Sogda Med — bu shunchaki klinika emas. Bu zamonaviy tibbiyot va insoniy g‘amxo‘rlik birlashgan maskandir. Biz kasallikni emas, inson salomatligini markazga qo‘yamiz.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vizual (Animatsiya uchun):</b> Klinika binosining mahobatli ko‘rinishi va logotipning oqlangan (elegant) animatsiyasi.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2-slayd:&nbsp;</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"5\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sarlavha:</b> Aniqlik — muvaffaqiyatli davolash garovi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Asosiy matn:</b> Bizda diagnostika ekspert darajasida o‘tkaziladi. Yuqori aniqlikdagi MRT va so‘nggi rusumdagi uskunalarimiz eng kichik detallarni ham o‘tkazib yubormaydi. Aniq tashxis — noto‘g‘ri muolajalardan sizni asraydi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vizual:</b> MRT apparatining stilizatsiya qilingan 3D modeli va yuqori sifatli skaner tasvirlari.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3-slayd:&nbsp;</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"7\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sarlavha:</b> Bilim va tajriba uyg‘unligi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Asosiy matn:</b> Sogda Med shifokorlari — o‘z sohasining intellektual yetakchilaridir. Bizda doimiy malaka oshirish va xalqaro tajriba asosiy o‘rinda turadi. Murakkab holatlarda jamoaviy konsilium orqali eng to‘g‘ri yechimni topamiz.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vizual:</b> Shifokorlarning vazmin va ishonchli siluetlari, tahlillarni muhokama qilish jarayoni (infografika ko‘rinishida).</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4-slayd:&nbsp;</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"9\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sarlavha:</b> Sizning vaqtingiz va xotirjamligingiz.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Asosiy matn:</b> Biz vaqt qadrini bilamiz. Navbatlarsiz qabul, individual yondashuv va maksimal darajadagi steril muhit. Sogda Med’da har bir bemor o‘zini xavfsiz va qadrli his qiladi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vizual:</b> Klinikadagi shinam interyer, sokin muhit va vaqtni tejashni anglatuvchi ramziy belgilar.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">5-slayd:&nbsp;</b></h3><ul data-path-to-node=\"11\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sarlavha:</b> Sog‘liq — hayot sifatining asosi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Asosiy matn:</b> Minglab bemorlarimiz bizga o‘zining eng qimmatli boyligini ishonib topshirishgan. Kelajagingizga bugun investitsiya qiling. Sogda Med — salomatligingizning ishonchli himoyachisi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><b>&nbsp;Tel:&nbsp;&nbsp;</b>\"Sogda Med —\n\n<!--StartFragment--><span style=\" font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">📞 (95) 411-03-03&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\" font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">📞 (95) 412-03-03</span><!--EndFragment-->\n\n Sog‘liqni boshqarish san\'ati\" degan shior chiqadi.</p></li></ul><!--EndFragment-->\n\n<br></div><div>🔗 MATERIAL LINK:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVNZU63DB2y/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp;igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVNZU63DB2y/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp;igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==</a></div><div><br></div><div>💭 BATAFSIL: Stilga moslab</div>',NULL,NULL,'2026-04-29 14:52:36','2026-05-06 05:45:05'),
