(1963,31,39,34,'Mayskiy 2','review',1,NULL,'<p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">❇️ VIDEO RAQAMI: 09</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📌 VAZIFA:</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Ssenariy №7: Steril Muhit va To\'liq Nazorat - MASHINA OLDIDA \n<br>\n<br>Issiq havoda tuxum o‘z sifatini necha daqiqada yo‘qotishini bilasizmi?\n<br>\n<br>Atigi 20 daqiqa! Shuning uchun biz mahsulotni faqat sovutgichlj transportlarda tashiymiz.\n<br>\n<br>Mayskiyda harorat zanjiri uzilmaydi. Bizning tuxumlarimiz harorati nazoratga olingan maxsus obmorxonada saqlanadi va buyurtma uchun sovutgichli mashinalarda yo‘l davomida +5 gradus haroratda yetkazib beriladi. \n<br>\n<br>Bu esa eng tuxumlarni yuqori sifatda yetkazib berilishini ta’minlaydi. \n<br>\n<br>Mayskiy — Sifat va xavfsizlik uyg\'unligi!<br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📜 MATERIAL LINKI:</p>',NULL,NULL,'2026-05-04 13:27:29','2026-05-12 04:52:32'),
