(1967,22,7,34,'SMZ','review',1,NULL,'<p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">❇️ VIDEO RAQAMI:15</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📌 VAZIFA:</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Nega aynan SMZ zavodidan metall list va rulonlarni xarid qilish kerakligini bilasizmi?\n<br>\n<br>Biz O’zbekistondagi import hajmi bo’yicha eng katta zavodlardan biri hisoblanamiz va keng assortimentdagi list va rulonlarni taklif etamiz!\n<br>\n<br>1. Sovuq o\'ramali list. Qalinligi 0,5mm dan 2 mm gacha.\n<br>2. Sovuq o’ramali rulonlar. Qalinligi 0.27dan 2 mmgacha.\n<br>3. Issiq o’ramali listlar. 1.5mm dan 20 mm gacha. \n<br>\n<br>Bundan tashqari, sizning ehtiyojingizga qarab Toshkentdagi omborxonamizdan ham ushbu mahsulotlarni xarid qilishingiz mumkin!\n<br>\n<br>SMZ - siz izlagan sifat aynan shu yerda. Bog’lanish uchun hoziroq ekrandagi raqamlarga qo’ng’iroq qiling!<br></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📜 MATERIAL LINKI:</p>',NULL,NULL,'2026-05-04 14:10:57','2026-05-07 06:28:34'),
