(2108,13,12,12,'Bkk','review',1,NULL,'<div>📌 VAZIFA:carusel</div><div><br></div><div>📜 MATNI:\n\n<!--StartFragment--><h4 data-path-to-node=\"3\">1-slayd:&nbsp;</h4><p data-path-to-node=\"4\">&nbsp;Xodimlar sizga ishonishini xohlaysizmi? 🤔</p><p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Taglavha:</b> Dunyo bestsellerlari dan olingan 3 ta oltin maslahat.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><i data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">(Rasm: Zamonaviy rahbar va uning ortida jipslashgan jamoa obrazi)</i></p><hr data-path-to-node=\"7\"><h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\">2-slayd: 1-maslahat. \"Qora quti\" effekti: Xatolarni jazolamang</h4><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Matn:</b> Mettyu Sayedning \"Qora quti\" kitobida aytilganidek, aviatsiyada halokatlar yashirilmaydi, aksincha o\'rganiladi.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"10\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Amaliy maslahat:</b> Jamoangizda xato qilgan xodimni aybdor qidirmang, tizimdagi kamchilikni qidiring. Xodim xatosini tan olganida jazolanmasligini bilsa, u sizga bor haqiqatni aytadi.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Natija:</b> Ishonch qo\'rquv yo\'q joyda tug\'iladi.</p><hr data-path-to-node=\"12\"><h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\">3-slayd: 2-maslahat. \"Nima uchun?\" (Simon Sinek)</h4><p data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Matn:</b> Simon Sinekning \"Nima uchun?\" (Start with Why) konsepsiyasiga ko\'ra, odamlar nima qilayotganingizga emas, nima uchun qilayotganingizga ergashadilar.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"15\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Amaliy maslahat:</b> Jamoaga faqat topshiriq bermang, bu topshiriq kompaniya missiyasi uchun qanchalik muhimligini tushuntiring. Qarorlaringiz sababini ochiq ayting.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"16\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Natija:</b> Xodim o\'zini \"shunchaki murvat\" emas, katta maqsadning qismi deb his qiladi.</p><hr data-path-to-node=\"17\"><h4 data-path-to-node=\"18\">4-slayd: 3-maslahat. Ekstremal javobgarlik (Jocko Willink)</h4><p data-path-to-node=\"19\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Matn:</b> Agar jamoa xatoga yo\'l qo\'ysa — bu rahbarning xatosi. Agar jamoa g\'alaba qozonsa — bu jamoaning yutug\'i.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"20\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Amaliy maslahat:</b> Muammo bo\'lganida \"ular tushunmadi\" demang, \"men yetarli tushuntira olmadim\" deb mas\'uliyatni bo\'yningizga oling.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"21\"><b data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Natija:</b> Rahbar mas\'uliyatdan qochmasa, xodimlar ham mas\'uliyatli bo\'lishni boshlaydi.</p><hr data-path-to-node=\"22\"><h4 data-path-to-node=\"23\">5-slayd: Xulosa va Savol</h4><p data-path-to-node=\"24\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Xulosa:</b> Ishonch — bu uzoq muddatli investitsiya. Uni qozonish uchun samimiylik va tizimli yondashuv kerak.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"25\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sizningcha, rahbar uchun eng muhim hislat nima?</b></p><p data-path-to-node=\"26\">1️⃣ Adolat</p><p data-path-to-node=\"27\">2️⃣ Bilim</p><p data-path-to-node=\"28\">3️⃣ Tinglay olish qobiliyati</p><p data-path-to-node=\"29\"><i data-path-to-node=\"29\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">(Fikringizni izohlarda qoldiring! 👇)</i></p><!--EndFragment-->\n\n</div><div>🔗 MATERIAL LINK:<a href=\"https://t.me/c/1184571207/1/257155\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.me/c/1184571207/1/257155</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://t.me/c/1184571207/1/257156\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.me/c/1184571207/1/257156</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://t.me/c/1184571207/1/257157\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.me/c/1184571207/1/257157</a><br></div><div>💭 BATAFSIL:</div>',NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 19:33:01','2026-05-11 10:10:03'),
