in-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\">Tez tibbiy yordam bo‘limida ishlaganman, hayot-mamot holatlarini ko‘p ko‘rganman.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\">Hozir esa Polidar Pharm’da menejer sifatida faoliyat yuritaman.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\">Sport bilan shug‘ullanaman va sog‘lom turmush tarzini juda muhim deb bilaman.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\">Bu sahifada men yurak sog‘lig‘i haqida murakkab narsalarni oddiy qilib tushuntiraman.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\">Qanday odatlar zarar qiladi, qachon xavotirlanish kerak va o‘zingizni qanday himoya qilish mumkin — shu haqida gaplashamiz.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'; min-height: 14.3px\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px \'system-ui\'\"><span style=\" font-weight: bold; font-style: normal\">Agar sizga yurak sog‘liqi haqida foydali va aniq ma’lumotlar qiziq bo‘lsa, sahifamga obuna bo’ling</span></p><br><p></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📜 MATERIAL LINKI:</p>',NULL,NULL,'2026-05-08 13:49:00','2026-05-12 04:52:41'),
