(2188,28,12,28,'Upsel','review',1,NULL,'<p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">❇️ VIDEO RAQAMI:</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📌 VAZIFA:</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📜 MATERIAL LINKI:</p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><br>Ko\'p sotuvchilar biror kitob o\'qib, \"Endi sotuvni 3 barobarga oshiraman\" deb o\'ylaydi.<br><br>Lekin bunday bo\'lmaydi.<br>Chunki sotuv — bu shunchaki so\'z emas.<br><br>Sotuvning katta qismi sizning ohangingizga bog\'liq. Mijoz siz aytgan gapni emas — gap ortidagi niyatingizni his qiladi.<br><br> Va buni nafaqat ovozingiz, balki butun qiyofangiz — mimika, nigoh, tana holati — hammasi birga yetkazadi.<br><br>Hatto telefonda gaplashganda ham.<br>Ohangni o\'rganishning eng yaxshi usuli — uni oddiy hayotda mashq qilish.<br><br>Masalan, kimdir \"U zinadan yiqilib tushibdi\" desa — siz o\'ylamasdan, ichingizdan: \"Voy, nima bo\'ldi o\'zi?!\" — deb yuborasiz.<br><br>Mana shu — xavotir ohangi. U tabiiy chiqadi, chunki his haqiqiy.<br><br>Sotuvda ham xuddi shunday. Agar mijozning muammosi sizga chinakam muhim bo\'lsa — ohang o\'z-o\'zidan to\'g\'ri chiqadi. <br>Rol o\'ynamaysiz. Bu shunchaki sizning bir qismingizga aylanadi.<!--EndFragment--><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 06:23:49','2026-05-15 10:14:28'),
