‘z vazifasini oddiy tilda tushuntiradi.<br data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"393\">\n<strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"410\">Vizual uslub:</strong> mahsulotlar stol ustida yoki dala fonida turadi, kamera har biriga yaqinlashganda «tilga kiradi». Ovoz mahsulot nomidan beriladi.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"545\">\n<h3 data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"569\" data-section-id=\"1wr0m9x\">🎥 KADR 1 — HOOK</h3>\n<p data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"753\"><strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"580\">Video:</strong> Stol ustida 3 ta mahsulot turibdi: <strong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"633\">Grasidim Full</strong>, <strong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"650\">Terzim MIXX</strong>, <strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"667\">Clomit PLUS</strong>. Kamera sekin yaqinlashadi. Birdan mahsulotlar «gapira boshlagandek» effekt beriladi.</p>\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"858\"><strong data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"764\">Ovoz:</strong><br data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"767\">\n«Siz bizni oddiy agrodori deb o‘ylaysiz…<br data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"810\">\nLekin har birimizning dalada o‘z vazifamiz bor.»</p>\n<p data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"922\"><strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"880\">Ekrandagi yozuv:</strong><br data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"883\">\n«Har bir mahsulotning o‘z vazifasi bor»</p>\n<hr data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"927\">\n<h3 data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"969\" data-section-id=\"1ojaivt\">🎥 KADR 2 — Grasidim Full gapiradi</h3>\n<p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1105\"><strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"980\">Video:</strong> Kamera yashil qopqoqli <strong data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1021\">Grasidim Full</strong> mahsulotiga yaqinlashadi. Orqa fonda boshoqli begona o‘tlar chiqqan dala ko‘rinadi.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1269\"><strong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1131\">Grasidim Full ovozi:</strong><br data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1134\">\n«Men — Grasidim Full.<br data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1158\">\nMening ishim — boshoqli begona o‘tlar bilan kurashish.<br data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1215\">\nDaladagi foydali ekin o‘sishi kerak, begona o‘t emas.»</p>\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1343\"><strong data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1291\">Ekrandagi yozuv:</strong><br data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1294\">\n«Grasidim Full — boshoqli begona o‘tlarga qarshi»</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1348\">\n<h3 data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1388\" data-section-id=\"61ivy4\">🎥 KADR 3 — Terzim MIXX gapiradi</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1508\"><strong data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1399\">Video:</strong> Kamera <strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1422\">Terzim MIXX</strong> mahsulotiga o‘tadi. Orqa fonda makkajo‘xori maydoni, orasida turli begona o‘tlar bor.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1723\"><strong data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1532\">Terzim MIXX ovozi:</strong><br data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1535\">\n«Men esa — Terzim MIXX.<br data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1561\">\nMakkajo‘xori maydonida keng bargli va boshoqli begona o‘tlar ko‘paysa, men ishga tushaman.<br data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1654\">\n3 komponentli tarkibim bilan maydonni toza saqlashga yordam beraman.»</p>\n<p data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1793\"><strong data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1745\">Ekrandagi yozuv:</strong><br data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1748\">\n«Terzim MIXX — makkajo‘xori maydonlari uchun»</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1798\">\n<h3 data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1838\" data-section-id=\"n91g20\">🎥 KADR 4 — Clomit PLUS gapiradi</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"2002\"><strong data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1849\">Video:</strong> Kamera to‘q sariq qopqoqli <strong data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1892\">Clomit PLUS</strong> mahsulotiga yaqinlashadi. Orqa fonda bargga yopishgan zararkunanda animatsiya yoki makro kadrda ko‘rsatiladi.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2208\"><strong data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2026\">Clomit PLUS ovozi:</strong><br data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2029\">\n«Mening ismim — Clomit PLUS.<br data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2060\">\nMen begona o‘tga emas, zararkunandalarga qarshi kurashaman.<br data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2122\">\nSo‘ruvchi va kemiruvchi hasharotlar ekinga zarar bermasligi uchun men kerak bo‘laman.»</p>\n<p data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2273\"><strong data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2230\">Ekrandagi yozuv:</strong><br data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2233\">\n«Clomit PLUS — zararkunandalarga qarshi»</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2278\">\n<h3 data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2316\" data-section-id=\"tl4h6x\">🎥 KADR 5 — Uchalasining farqi</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2399\"><strong data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2327\">Video:</strong> Uch mahsulot yonma-yon turadi. Har birining yonida qisqa belgi chiqadi.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2588\"><strong data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2410\">Ovoz:</strong><br data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2413\">\n«Demak, eslab qoling:<br data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2437\">\nGrasidim Full — boshoqli begona o‘tlar uchun.<br data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2485\">\nTerzim MIXX — makkajo‘xoridagi kompleks begona o‘tlar uchun.<br data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2548\">\nClomit PLUS — zararkunandalarga qarshi.»</p>\n<p data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2648\"><strong data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2610\">Ekrandagi yozuv:</strong><br data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2613\">\n«To‘g‘ri mahsulot — to‘g‘ri natija»</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2653\">\n<h3 data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2693\" data-section-id=\"11t4ghr\">🎥 KADR 6 — Xavfsizlik eslatmasi</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2781\"><strong data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2704\">Video:</strong> Agronom qo‘lqop, niqob va himoya kiyimi bilan mahsulot yorlig‘ini o‘qiyapti.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2926\"><strong data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2792\">Ovoz:</strong><br data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2795\">\n«Biz kuchli yordamchimiz.<br data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2823\">\nLekin har doim yorliqdagi ko‘rsatmaga amal qiling.<br data-start=\"2873\" data-end=\"2876\">\nMe’yor, ekin turi va qo‘llash vaqti — juda muhim.»</p>\n<p data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2974\"><strong data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2948\">Ekrandagi yozuv:</strong><br data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2951\">\n«Avval yorliqni o‘qing»</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2976\" data-end=\"2979\">\n<h3 data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3010\" data-section-id=\"43bzkl\">🎥 KADR 7 — FINAL / CTA</h3>\n<p data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3097\"><strong data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3021\">Video:</strong> Toza, sog‘lom ko‘rinayotgan dala. Mahsulotlar old planda chiroyli terilgan.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3229\"><strong data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3108\">Ovoz:</strong><br data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3111\">\n«Dalangizga nima kerakligini bilmasangiz, mutaxassis bilan maslahatlashing.<br data-start=\"3186\" data-end=\"3189\">\nTo‘g‘ri tanlov — hosilga xizmat qiladi.»</p>\n<p data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3287\"><strong data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3251\">Ekrandagi yozuv:</strong><br data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3254\">\n«Savolingiz bormi? Izohda yozing»</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3292\">\n<h2 data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3331\" data-section-id=\"1xhb7ov\">Qisqa versiya uchun kuchli monolog</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3706\" data-is-only-node=\"\">«Men — Grasidim Fullman. Boshoqli begona o‘tlar ko‘paysa, dalaga men kerak bo‘laman.<br data-start=\"3417\" data-end=\"3420\">\nMen — Terzim MIXXman. Makkajo‘xori maydonida keng bargli va boshoqli o‘tlar bilan ishlayman.<br data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3515\">\nMen esa — Clomit PLUSman. Men zararkunandalarga qarshi kurashaman.<br data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3584\">\nBiz har xil vazifaga egamiz. Shuning uchun eng muhimi — mahsulotni to‘g‘ri tanlash va yorliqdagi ko‘rsatmaga amal qilish.»</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div></div></div><!--EndFragment-->\n\n<p></p><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">📜 MATERIAL LINKI:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://t.me/c/1184571207/1/257446\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.me/c/1184571207/1/257446</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://t.me/c/1184571207/1/257446\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.me/c/1184571207/1/257446</a></p>',NULL,1100,'2026-05-11 09:33:50','2026-05-19 12:56:35'),
