(2243,2,12,23,'Bkk','review',1,NULL,'<div>📌 VAZIFA:carusel</div><div><br></div><div>📜 MATNI:\n\n<!--StartFragment--><h4 data-path-to-node=\"3\">1-bet:&nbsp;</h4><p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Xodimlarning tez-tez almashishi shunchaki kadrlar muammosi emas, bu biznesingizning \"minus\"ga kirishi:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"5\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Pul yo\'qotish:</b> Yangi odamni topish va o\'qitish eski xodimning 6-9 oylik maoshiga teng tushadi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vaqt o\'g\'risi:</b> Jamoangiz ishlash o\'rniga har oy yangi odamga \"nonvoyxona\"ni tushuntirish bilan band bo\'ladi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Atmosfera o\'lishi:</b> Qolgan xodimlarda \"hamma ketyapti, demak bu kema cho\'kyapti\" degan qo\'rquv uyg\'onadi.</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node=\"6\"><h4 data-path-to-node=\"7\">2-bet:&nbsp; — Nega ular sizdan \"qochishmoqda\"? 🏃‍♂️💨</h4><p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Odamlar kompaniyadan emas, rahbarning xatosidan ketadi:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"9\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">\"Qora quti\" yo\'qligi:</b> Xatolarni tahlil qilish o\'rniga aybdorni qidirasiz — xodim jazolanishdan qo\'rqib, \"surish\" payida bo\'ladi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Maqsadsizlik:</b> Xodim nima uchun ishlayotganini tushunmaydi, u o\'zini shunchaki robot deb his qiladi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mas\'uliyatdan qochish:</b> Agar muvaffaqiyatsizlikda faqat xodim aybdor bo\'lsa , u sizga hech qachon ishonmaydi.</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node=\"10\"><h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\">3-bet: Yechim — Ularni \"ushlab\" qolishning 3 ta yo\'li 🛡️</h4><p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Tizimni o\'zgartiring, shunda xodimlar o\'zi qoladi:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"13\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Xatoga ruxsat bering:</b> Xatolarni o\'sish nuqtasi deb biling, xodim haqiqatni aytishdan qo\'rqmasin — bu ishonchning asosi.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">\"Nima uchun\"ni tushuntiring:</b> Unga shunchaki topshiriq bermang, bu ish kompaniyaga qanday foyda keltirishini ko\'rsating.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Javobgarlikni bo\'yningizga oling:</b> Xato bo\'ldimi? Rahbar sifatida mas\'uliyatni oling. Shunda jamoa sizga ergashadi.</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node=\"14\"><p data-path-to-node=\"15\">&nbsp;Xodim ketsa — bu xato. Xodim ketishi \"tizim\"ga aylansa — bu falokat! 📉</p><p data-path-to-node=\"16\">\"Qora quti\" falsafasini biznesga joriy qilmaguningizcha, eng zo\'r kadrlaringiz ham raqobatchiga o\'tib ketaveradi. Masala faqat maoshda emas, masala — ishonchda!</p><p data-path-to-node=\"17\">Sizningcha, xodimlar eng ko\'p nima sababdan ishdan ketishadi? Izohlarda yozing, gaplashamiz! 👇</p><!--EndFragment-->\n\n</div><div>🔗 MATERIAL LINK:</div><div><br></div><div>💭 BATAFSIL: mavzuga mos generatsuya</div>',NULL,NULL,'2026-05-12 04:01:24','2026-05-16 08:34:05'),
